+        "The file /nlohmann__json/include/nlohmann/json.hpp has been edited. "
+        "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet:\n"
+        "  137\t        JSON_THROW(type_error::create(305, \"cannot use operator[] with object\"));\n"
+        "Review the changes and make sure they are as expected.\n"
