+        "[INFO] Scanning for projects...\n"
+        "[ERROR] [ERROR] Some problems were encountered while processing the POMs:\n"
+        "[FATAL] Non-resolvable parent POM for com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind:2.17.0-SNAPSHOT\n"
+        "[ERROR] To see the full stack trace of the errors, re-run Maven with the -e switch.\n"
+    )
+    assert _label("mvn test -pl . -Dtest=WithPathTest -DfailIfNoTests=false", obs, language="java") == "Ve"
